/** V188 franchise arsenal, lot C (spec 014, owner decision of 2026-11-23): the
 * remaining human weapons of the franchise that lots A and B listed as
 * « reste ». Raw rows only — src/weapon-catalog-franchise-v188.js turns them
 * into catalogue entries and ledger rows with the lot-B builders, so both lots
 * share one admission (`provisional-plaque-purchasable`), one drawn plaque and
 * one ledger shape. Nothing is certified 1:1:
 *  - documented: only what a source READ during this pass states;
 *  - adapted [PROPOSÉ]: every gameplay number;
 *  - to define: what the sources do not settle.
 * Evidence labels:
 *  - `game-list-secondary`: a guide or list read item by item this pass;
 *  - `search-extract-secondary`: only a search-engine extract of a fan page
 *    (the page itself answered HTTP 402/403);
 *  - `fan-writeup-secondary`: a fan article describing the item;
 *  - `comic-summary-secondary`: a fan summary of a comic;
 *  - `index-name-only`: the V170 backlog names the item and no page could be
 *    read — the row documents NOTHING and every value is [PROPOSÉ].
 * Ids continue after 235 and skip 256 and 296: the historical V112 visual
 * resolver maps them (like 216) onto the Heavy Pulse Rifle plate by modulo.
 * Predator weapons stay excluded.
 */
